<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasControlPacketType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:genid122 .
_:genid122 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:genid124 .
_:genid124 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid123 .
_:genid123 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
