# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
