_:genid138 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid137 .
_:genid137 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid137 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#ConnectProperties> .
