<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasNoLocal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bit 2 of the Subscription Options represents the No Local option."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasNoLocal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No Local subscription option. If 1, the Server MUST NOT forward messages published by this Client back to it."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasNoLocal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has No Local"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasNoLocal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "If the value is 1, Application Messages MUST NOT be forwarded to a connection with a ClientID equal to the ClientID of the publishing connection."@en .
