<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasServerReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Server Reference Property. UTF-8 string suggesting an alternate Server the Client may use."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasServerReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Server Reference"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasServerReference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Followed by a UTF-8 Encoded String which can be used by the Client to identify another Server to use."@en .
