<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSessionExpiryInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Session Expiry Interval Property. Four Byte Integer seconds defining session lifetime after disconnect."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSessionExpiryInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Session Expiry Interval"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSessionExpiryInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The Session Expiry Interval MUST NOT be sent on a DISCONNECT by the Server."@en .
