<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSharedSubscriptionAvailable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shared Subscription Available Property in CONNACK. Byte 0/1 indicating server support for shared subscriptions."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSharedSubscriptionAvailable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Shared Subscription Available"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSharedSubscriptionAvailable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Followed by a Byte field. If present, this byte declares whether the Server supports Shared Subscriptions. A value is 0 means that Shared Subscriptions are not supported. A value of 1 means Shared Subscriptions are supported."@en .
