<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasSubscriptionIdentifierAvailable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasProperty> .
