<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#usesTLS> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True if the Network Connection is protected via TLS, otherwise false."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#usesTLS> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "uses TLS"@en .
